Package: com.music27.tweak
Name: Music27
Version: 1.1.35
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Restyle Apple Music on iOS 16/17 toward the iOS 26/27 Liquid Glass look. 1.1.35: hides the whole stock album button row instead of just the two capsule backgrounds, so the red Play/Shuffle glyphs no longer show through the glass row, and reworks the mini-pill tap to use accessibilityActivate.
Maintainer: Music27
Author: Music27
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
